OL,3,AStreeting says UK 'stands with
OL,4,AZelensky' after Trump criticises
OL,5,AUkraine leader
OL,6,
OL,7,FDefence Secretary Wes Streeting says
OL,8,F"we stand with President Zelensky" and
OL,9,Fcalls for "strong Western unity" over
OL,10,Fof Ukraine
OL,12,FIt comes after Ukraine's President
OL,13,FVolodymyr Zelensky condemned President
OL,14,FDonald Trump's announcement of a deal
OL,15,Fto import Russian diesel into the US -
OL,16,FTrump later said Ukraine needs a new
OL,17,Fleader
OL,19,FShadow chancellor Andrew Griffith says
OL,20,Fthere is a "big issue" with the cost of
OL,21,Fenergy, but "if you want a peaceful
OL,22,Fworld, you don't do that sort of deal"
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
