OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Time for Ukraine to get new
OL,4,Apresident,' says Trump after Zelensky
OL,5,Acondemns diesel deal
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrump told reporters outside the White
OL,8,FHouse on Saturday that Zelensky "wants
OL,9,Fto make problems for the world" by
OL,10,Fcontinuing to authorise attacks on
OL,11,FRussian refineries.
OL,13,F"He'd better damn well stop," Trump
OL,14,Fsaid, before suggesting Ukraine should
OL,15,F"get a new leader who can make a deal".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
